{"title": "Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)", "pageid": 30290, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Has stack priority", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Defensive Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Sanctuary of Loss</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The Nightbringer's dark arcana stops this entity being directly targeted by spells or attacks until it takes a harmful action.</li>\n<li>Areas of effect can still harm this entity.</li>\n<li>Viconia can still use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heartwrench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\">Heartwrench</a> and keep this protection. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SANCTUARY</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSANCTUARY%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSANCTUARY%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 1</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Sanctuary_of_Loss\">Sources of Sanctuary of Loss</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary of Loss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss\">Sanctuary of Loss</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SANCTUARY</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sanctuary\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary (Condition)\">Sanctuary</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't be targeted by enemy attacks or spells. However, it can still take damage from spells that influence a larger area. Condition ends if the affected entity attacks or harms another creature, and will receive <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_Blocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary Blocked (Condition)\">Sanctuary Blocked</a> for 1 turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sanctuary_of_Loss\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary_of_Loss_(Condition)\" title=\"Sanctuary of Loss (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary of Loss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Legendary_Action_Defensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Sanctuary of Loss</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The Nightbringer's dark arcana stops this entity being directly targeted by spells or attacks until it takes a harmful action.</li>\n<li>Areas of effect can still harm this entity.</li>\n<li>Viconia can still use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heartwrench\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heartwrench\" title=\"Heartwrench\">Heartwrench</a> and keep this protection.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Spindleweb_Sanctuary\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spindleweb_Sanctuary_(Condition)\" title=\"Spindleweb Sanctuary (Condition)\">Spindleweb Sanctuary</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity can't be targeted by enemy attacks or spells. However, it can still take damage from spells that influence a larger area. If the affected entity attacks or harms another creature, the sanctuary will shatter, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">3d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> to nearby creatures.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000830\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2617/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33721/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9017/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops 